# Complexity & Scale Safety

Limits (enforced by `make ai-complexity`):
- Max **300 lines** per file
- Max **80 lines** per function
- Max **15** cyclomatic complexity

If exceeded, split into:
- handler → service → repository
- one file per use case when needed

Avoid deep nesting; prefer early returns.

Run `make ai-complexity` before merge.
